# Setlist Archive URLs (/dpro)

All URL slugs for **Setlist Archive** pages must start with `/dpro`.

## Convention

- **Base path**: `/dpro`
- **Examples**:
  - Years: `/dpro/years/{year_id}` (year_id = UUID from Supabase `years` table)
  - Tours: `/dpro/tours` (and `/dpro/tours/...` for nested routes)
  - Songs: `/dpro/songs`, Stats: `/dpro/stats`, Personnel: `/dpro/personnel`, Venues: `/dpro/venues`, Discography: `/dpro/discography`, Lists: `/dpro/lists`, Setlist Game: `/dpro/setlistgame`, Submit: `/dpro/submit`

## Implementation

- **App Router**: Place Setlist Archive pages under `app/(main)/dpro/...` (e.g. `app/(main)/dpro/years/[year_id]/page.tsx`, `app/(main)/dpro/tours/page.tsx`).
- **Links**: Use `/dpro/...` for any link that targets a Setlist Archive page (sidebar, breadcrumbs, internal links).
- **Breadcrumbs**: For any Setlist Archive page, the first breadcrumb segment after Home must show **"Setlist Archive"** (not "Dpro"); link target remains `/dpro`.
- **Pathname checks**: Treat `pathname.startsWith("/dpro")` as “user is in Setlist Archive” for sidebar expansion and active state.

## Checklist when adding or changing Setlist Archive routes

- [ ] Route path starts with `/dpro`
- [ ] Sidebar nav uses `/dpro/...` for the corresponding item
- [ ] Any internal links to setlist pages use `/dpro/...`
